WHATSAPP CHAT ANALYZER :-

A Streamlit-based WhatsApp Chat Analysis project.

FEATURES:-

- Total Messages
- Word Count
- Most Active Users
- Emoji Analysis
- Monthly Timeline
- Daily Timeline
- Activity Heatmap

BUILT WITH :-

- Python (Version - 3.12)  
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Streamlit

RUN LOCALLY :-

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
